<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Can't speak for everyone but I had a good time last night.<P>Was interesting running 3 chars for a while there  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>We had 3 dings last night in Alpha.<BR>Brinne - 42<BR>Ghowen - 37 (guest spot)<BR>Erlas  - 44<P>Boon of the Garou ROCKS!!!!!<P>4 more levels for the lowest member of regular Alpha night and we're planes capable.  Only place we could really get to would be Growth or Fear.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>One of the giants we killed dropped a straw spun belt that went to Brinne.  Couple gems and lots of plat. over 300pp for the night with the sale of the loot.<P>I was sorry that Doxx couldn't make it, but I'm glad that Gastro/Ghowen was there  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>I look forward to out next night of adventure.<P>--------------------<P> <img src="http://people.mn.mediaone.net/raven13/images/Ghall.gif"> 
</FONT>
