I had a good time, as well.  Brod was pulling fast and furious, so there was little time to socialize, but I managed to get Gastro's pedicure done with some of that quick dry polish.<P>I also finally had some success with the bard charm technique...  for me the trick is all in the hot keys and having them set up correctly and hitting them in the right order.  I had been trying to target the mob for my pet to attack manually...  that wastes a lot of time.  Medec reminded me that I have an assist key and what it does   <IMG SRC="eek.gif" border="0"> and that made the whole process work much more smoothly.  Looking forward to workin' it some more and letting Gas use less mana for mezzes and more for werewolf form.   <IMG SRC="wink.gif" border="0"><P>--------------------<P>Michelle<BR>Eklah Dechoklah, 34th level Hugger of Tunare's Trees<BR>Brinne Strument, 44rd level Chanteuse en Bleu<BR>Mortana 12th level Cleric Healer and Death Dealer<BR>Glyneth 15th level Paladin and Pal o' Mine<BR>Gaiana Just a 'lil Mage
</FONT>
